---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Cash Offer or Full-Service Listing in Grapevine & DFW | Shaver Realty Group"
  description="Explore a competitive cash offer or full-service listing for your Grapevine, Flower Mound, Colleyville or Southlake home. Local expertise, clear options, no pressure."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Cash Offer or Traditional Listing?</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Need a faster, simpler path? I can help you explore competitive cash offers.<br />
        Prefer a traditional sale with strong marketing and personal representation? 
        My full-service listing plans start at 2%.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">Serving Grapevine • Flower Mound • Colleyville • Southlake</p>
      <a href="#options" class="btn btn-dark">See Your Options →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TWO PATHS -->
  <section id="options" class="paths-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Two Clear Paths. You Decide.</h2>
      <p class="intro-text">
        As your local Grapevine listing specialist, I’ll walk you through both options so you can choose what fits your timeline and goals.
      </p>

      <div class="paths-grid">
        <!-- Cash Path -->
        <div class="path-card">
          <h3>Cash Offer</h3>
          <p class="path-desc">Speed & Simplicity</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Competitive cash offers through trusted partners</li>
            <li>Potential to close in as little as 7–21 days</li>
            <li>Sell as-is — no repairs or staging required</li>
            <li>Minimal or no showings</li>
            <li>Higher certainty of closing</li>
            <li>I guide you through the entire process</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="path-note">A strong option when timing or convenience is the priority.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Listing Path -->
        <div class="path-card popular">
          <div class="badge">Popular Choice</div>
          <h3>Full-Service Listing</h3>
          <p class="path-desc">Professional Representation</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Transparent plans starting at 2%</li>
            <li>Professional photography & marketing</li>
            <li>Full MLS exposure + open houses</li>
            <li>Strategic pricing based on local comps</li>
            <li>Direct communication from listing to closing</li>
            <li>Personal attention throughout</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="path-note">Ideal when you want strong marketing and full representation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW CASH WORKS -->
  <section class="how-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How the Cash Offer Process Works</h2>
      <p class="intro-text">
        You still get a local agent looking out for your best interest while exploring cash options.
      </p>

      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <h3>Share Your Details</h3>
          <p>Tell me about your home and situation. No obligation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <h3>Review Cash Options</h3>
          <p>I’ll present competitive cash offers from trusted partners for your consideration.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <h3>Compare Side-by-Side</h3>
          <p>We look at the cash numbers next to a traditional listing so you can see the real trade-offs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">4</div>
          <h3>You Choose</h3>
          <p>Move forward with a cash offer or list with me. Completely your decision.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- COMPARISON -->
  <section class="compare-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Quick Comparison</h2>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Factor</th>
              <th>Cash Offer</th>
              <th>Full-Service Listing</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Typical Timeline</td>
              <td>7–21 days</td>
              <td>Market dependent</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Repairs & Staging</td>
              <td>Usually not required</td>
              <td>Recommended for best results</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Showings</td>
              <td>Minimal or none</td>
              <td>Yes</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Closing Certainty</td>
              <td>High</td>
              <td>Strong with proper preparation</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>My Role</td>
              <td>Guide and advocate</td>
              <td>Full listing representation</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LOCAL ADVANTAGE -->
  <section class="local-section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Why Work With a Local Specialist</h2>
      <p>
        Cash offers can be a useful tool, but the numbers only make sense when someone who knows Grapevine, Flower Mound, Colleyville, and Southlake is helping you evaluate them. 
        I live and work in these communities every day, so I can give you an honest read on whether a cash offer is competitive for your specific property — or whether listing is the better route.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FORM -->
  <section class="form-section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <div class="form-card">
        <h2>See What Fits Your Situation</h2>
        <p class="form-sub">
          Share a few details and I’ll personally follow up within 24 hours with clear next steps.
        </p>

        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/mjybzdpa" method="POST" class="eval-form">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Cash Offer / Listing Inquiry" />
          
          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Full Name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Email *</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="phone">Phone *</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="address">Property Address</label>
            <input type="text" id="address" name="address" placeholder="Street, City" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="interest">I’m most interested in:</label>
            <select id="interest" name="interest">
              <option value="Cash Offer">Cash Offer</option>
              <option value="Full Listing">Full-Service Listing</option>
              <option value="Both / Not Sure">Compare both options</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="message">Anything else I should know? (optional)</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3"></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Get Clear Options →</button>
          <p class="privacy">No spam. No pressure. I’ll be in touch within 24 hours.</p>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="below-form">
        <p>Prefer to talk now?</p>
        <p class="contact-line">
          <a href="tel:2147172888">(214) 717-2888</a> · 
          <a href="mailto:john@shaverrealtygroup.com">john@shaverrealtygroup.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Keep the same styles as the previous version */
  .page-hero {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    color: #111;
    padding: 5.5rem 0 4.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #111;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444;
  }
  .hero-note {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1rem 2.2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-dark {
    background: #111;
    color: white;
  }
  .btn-dark:hover {
    background: #333;
  }
  .paths-section,
  .how-section,
  .compare-section,
  .local-section,
  .form-section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }
  .paths-section h2,
  .how-section h2,
  .compare-section h2,
  .local-section h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .intro-text {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    color: #555;
  }
  .paths-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .path-card {
    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
    background: white;
    position: relative;
  }
  .path-card.popular {
    border: 2px solid #111;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }
  .badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -13px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: #111;
    color: white;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.35rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .path-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .path-desc {
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .path-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .path-card li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: #333;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .path-card li::before {
    content: "✔";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #111;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .path-note {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #777;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .step {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .step-num {
    width: 42px;
    height: 42px;
    background: #111;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
  }
  .step h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .step p {
    color: #555;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .table-wrapper {
    overflow-x: auto;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }
  th {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .local-section {
    background: #f8f8f8;
  }
  .narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .local-section p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .form-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
  .form-card h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .form-sub {
    text-align: center;
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .field {
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }
  .field label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    color: #333;
  }
  .field input,
  .field select,
  .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  .field input:focus,
  .field select:focus,
  .field textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #111;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    width: 100%;
    background: #111;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 0.95rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #333;
  }
  .privacy {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #888;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
  }
  .below-form {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    color: #555;
  }
  .contact-line {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .contact-line a {
    color: #111;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .contact-line a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .page-hero h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
    .form-card {
      padding: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>